 to be different  given what happened to us  two years ago  but to use secrecy  and expand secrecy under the guise of  fighting terrorism is in the end going  to be a formula for the types of  activities that we've seen in the past  that as colin powell put it  weren't proud moments for our country  i'm going to stop you've been so  wonderful to sit here i appreciate it  i'm going to sit here and sign a few  books if anybody wants their book signed  but thank you so very much for coming  the pinochet file a declassified dossier  on atrocity and accountability is  published by the new press on the web at  newpress.com  [Music]  it's book tv's fifth anniversary this  fall on c-span 2

